    {
      "id": "schema-model-product",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5480,
      "y": 922,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 420,
      "text": "## Schema: Model Product\n- **Contract kind:** database\n- **Version:** 1.0.0\n- **Owner:** Forge\n- **Status:** active\n- **Review status:** approved\n- **Reviewed version:** 1.0.0\n- **Last reviewed:** 2026-11-01\n- **Review interval (days):** 180",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "schema",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Model Product",
          "kind": "database",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "owner": "Forge",
          "status": "active",
          "reviewStatus": "approved",
          "reviewedVersion": "1.0.0",
          "lastReviewed": "2026-11-01",
          "reviewIntervalDays": 180,
          "source": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://canvas.local/model-delivery/model-product/1.0.0\",\n  \"title\": \"Model Product\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"name\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"family\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"product\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"region_name\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"candidate\",\n        \"staged\",\n        \"production\",\n        \"retired\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"container_id\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"id\",\n    \"name\",\n    \"family\",\n    \"product\",\n    \"region_name\",\n    \"status\"\n  ]\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "schema-deployment",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5480,
      "y": 1874,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 420,
      "text": "## Schema: Deployment\n- **Contract kind:** database\n- **Version:** 1.0.0\n- **Owner:** Tower\n- **Status:** active\n- **Review status:** approved\n- **Reviewed version:** 1.0.0\n- **Last reviewed:** 2026-11-01\n- **Review interval (days):** 180",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "schema",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Deployment",
          "kind": "database",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "owner": "Tower",
          "status": "active",
          "reviewStatus": "approved",
          "reviewedVersion": "1.0.0",
          "lastReviewed": "2026-11-01",
          "reviewIntervalDays": 180,
          "source": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://canvas.local/model-delivery/deployment/1.0.0\",\n  \"title\": \"Deployment\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"model_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"previous_model_id\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"model_family\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"product\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"region_name\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"environment\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"staging\",\n        \"production\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"deployed_date\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date\"\n    },\n    \"image_uri\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"uri\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"id\",\n    \"model_id\",\n    \"environment\",\n    \"deployed_date\",\n    \"image_uri\"\n  ]\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "schema-cicd-history",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5480,
      "y": 446,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 420,
      "text": "## Schema: CI/CD History\n- **Contract kind:** database\n- **Version:** 1.0.0\n- **Owner:** Tower\n- **Status:** active\n- **Review status:** approved\n- **Reviewed version:** 1.0.0\n- **Last reviewed:** 2026-11-01\n- **Review interval (days):** 180",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "schema",
        "fields": {
          "name": "CI/CD History",
          "kind": "database",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "owner": "Tower",
          "status": "active",
          "reviewStatus": "approved",
          "reviewedVersion": "1.0.0",
          "lastReviewed": "2026-11-01",
          "reviewIntervalDays": 180,
          "source": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://canvas.local/model-delivery/cicd-history/1.0.0\",\n  \"title\": \"CI/CD History\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"model_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"staging_start_date\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ],\n      \"format\": \"date\"\n    },\n    \"staging_end_date\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ],\n      \"format\": \"date\"\n    },\n    \"production_start_date\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ],\n      \"format\": \"date\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"id\",\n    \"model_id\"\n  ]\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "schema-evaluation-result",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5480,
      "y": 1398,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 420,
      "text": "## Schema: Evaluation Result\n- **Contract kind:** database\n- **Version:** 1.0.0\n- **Owner:** Tower\n- **Status:** active\n- **Review status:** approved\n- **Reviewed version:** 1.0.0\n- **Last reviewed:** 2026-11-01\n- **Review interval (days):** 180",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "schema",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Evaluation Result",
          "kind": "database",
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "owner": "Tower",
          "status": "active",
          "reviewStatus": "approved",
          "reviewedVersion": "1.0.0",
          "lastReviewed": "2026-11-01",
          "reviewIntervalDays": 180,
          "source": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://canvas.local/model-delivery/evaluation-result/1.0.0\",\n  \"title\": \"Evaluation Result\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"model_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"run_date\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date\"\n    },\n    \"passed\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"prefect_run_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"id\",\n    \"model_id\",\n    \"run_date\",\n    \"passed\",\n    \"prefect_run_id\"\n  ]\n}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-delivery-design",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2508,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## Note: Delivery target design\n- **Note:** **Target design — not yet deployed.** Each protected-branch PR merge starts a separate run. `staging` delivers for evaluation; `main` delivers to production. Steps depend on the branch.\n\nTable headers use deployed fields. **Needs change** marks required changes.",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "note",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Delivery target design",
          "body": "**Target design — not yet deployed.** Each protected-branch PR merge starts a separate run. `staging` delivers for evaluation; `main` delivers to production. Steps depend on the branch.\n\nTable headers use deployed fields. **Needs change** marks required changes."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-register-example",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 2508,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## Note: Register candidate example\n- **Note:** **New row.** Illustrative values; other fields omitted.\n\n| id | name | family | product | region_name | status | container_id |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `1111…1111` | `model-x` | `thor` | `midthor` | `na` | **`candidate`** | `null` |\n\n**CI/CD History: new row**\n\n| id | model_id | staging_start_date | production_start_date |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `3333…3333` | `1111…1111` | `null` | `null` |\n\nTwo separate API requests today; model registration does not create History.",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "note",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Register candidate example",
          "body": "**New row.** Illustrative values; other fields omitted.\n\n| id | name | family | product | region_name | status | container_id |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `1111…1111` | `model-x` | `thor` | `midthor` | `na` | **`candidate`** | `null` |\n\n**CI/CD History: new row**\n\n| id | model_id | staging_start_date | production_start_date |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `3333…3333` | `1111…1111` | `null` | `null` |\n\nTwo separate API requests today; model registration does not create History."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-runtime-example",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2768,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## Note: Save image example\n- **Note:** **Update existing row.** Values are shortened.\n\n| id | name | status | container_id |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `1111…1111` | `model-x` | **`staged`** | `ECR image digest URI` |\n\n**API change needed:** the current runtime route also requires `task_definition_arn`. The target Registry reference is the image URI. ECS still uses a task definition.",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "note",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Save image example",
          "body": "**Update existing row.** Values are shortened.\n\n| id | name | status | container_id |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `1111…1111` | `model-x` | **`staged`** | `ECR image digest URI` |\n\n**API change needed:** the current runtime route also requires `task_definition_arn`. The target Registry reference is the image URI. ECS still uses a task definition."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-staging-example",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 2768,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## Note: Staging deployment example\n- **Note:** **New row.** This table shows deployed field names.\n\n| id | model_id | previous_model_id | model_family | product | region_name | deployed_date |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `7777…7777` | `1111…1111` | `null` | `thor` | `midthor` | `na` | `2026-11-04` |\n\n**API change needed:** record and select by environment; support multiple staged models. The image URI is currently on Model Product. Its final placement needs a decision.",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "note",
        "fields": {
          "name": "Staging deployment example",
          "body": "**New row.** This table shows deployed field names.\n\n| id | model_id | previous_model_id | model_family | product | region_name | deployed_date |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `7777…7777` | `1111…1111` | `null` | `thor` | `midthor` | `na` | `2026-11-04` |\n\n**API change needed:** record and select by environment; support multiple staged models. The image URI is currently on Model Product. Its final placement needs a decision."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-promotion-example",
