      "x": 40,
      "y": 3028,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## Note: Promotion deployment example\n- **Note:** **Update existing row.** Example assumes Model Y was previously selected.\n\n| id | model_id | previous_model_id | model_family | product | region_name | deployed_date |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `7777…7777` | `1111…1111` | `2222…2222` | `thor` | `midthor` | `na` | **`2026-11-11`** |\n\n**Model Product: update status**\n\n| id | name | status |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `1111…1111` | `model-x` | **`production`** |\n\n**API change needed:** record the environment and end staging. Current promotion updates a separate production slot.",
      "app": {
        "entityType": "note",
        "fields": {
